  "details": "Currently if you preload a world and then join it, the notification about the world having been preloaded persists. Obviously this is redundant information since you are now actually in the world you just preloaded. So it would be nice if that notification could be cleared automatically upon join.\n\nI keep running into this little edge case while world hopping - the usual flow is find a world, start preload, drop portal, go through portal, then I have to clear that notification once I load in.",
